language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit UiTransportSession.
capability CoherentUiBaseline.
functionality RecoverUiSession.
functionality CommitUiBaseline.
functionality ResyncRenderer.
functionality CloseUiSession.

UIRuntime contains UiTransportSession.
UiTransportSession provides CoherentUiBaseline.
UiTransportSession status proposed.
UiTransportSession cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/UIDomain/DetailedDesignDiscussion.md".
UiTransportSession owns RecoverUiSession.
RecoverUiSession realizes CoherentUiBaseline.
RecoverUiSession specifies "Track independent service/browser sessions, source and delivery sequences; typed resume and snapshot watermark before replaying later events.".
UiTransportSession owns CommitUiBaseline.
CommitUiBaseline realizes CoherentUiBaseline.
CommitUiBaseline specifies "Publish validated complete baseline and subsequent deliveries; sparse source sequence is not delivery loss.".
UiTransportSession owns ResyncRenderer.
ResyncRenderer realizes CoherentUiBaseline.
ResyncRenderer specifies "Bootstrap schema and state at compatible revisions without duplicating underlying domain subscriptions.".
UiTransportSession owns CloseUiSession.
CloseUiSession realizes CoherentUiBaseline.
CloseUiSession specifies "Stop new intents, account for unresolved command results and detach transports/subscriptions during explicit application shutdown; ordinary view disposal does not close a shared session.".
